<br><br>
Surface Nonmetal Mine<br>
(Limestone)
<br><br>
Non-Powered Haulage Accident<br>
February 19, 2007
<br><br>
Martin Marietta Materials Inc.<br>
Bakers Quarry<br>
Monroe, Union, North Carolina<br>
Mine I.D. No. 31-00071
<br><br>
Investigators
<br><br>
Jeffrey L. Phillips<br>
Supervisory Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
